# Frontier Dog stables: the stable hand's place (.pos, from the open bcc-stables config), the yard where the dogs for
# sale stand and the stable hand's dog menu is offered (.yard; .dogs = an unmeasured spot), and the regional breeds
# (old D19: each stable shows 3 of its 4, a new pick every 3 in-game days). The yard must be outdoors: inside the
# building the game opens its own stable menu. Valentine, Strawberry, Van Horn, Emerald and Saint Denis yards measured
# 17.11 (where the game walks Arthur out after its menu; the dogs stand in a row across that spot). Blackwater,
# Armadillo and Tumbleweed (no .yard) get the nearest outdoor navmesh point 10-18 m from the stable hand at run time if
# their .dogs spot is indoors (not seen in game: Arthur cannot get there).
# the dog trader in the yard (a man beside the dogs, his prompts under «Торговец собаками»)
trader_model=A_M_M_RANCHER_01
